 | `get_similar_channels` | Channels similar to one you give it | \"Find channels like mine\" → instant competitor list |\r\n40: | `check_faceless_channel` | Detects if a channel is faceless/AI-generated | Check if a top competitor is a real person or faceless |\r\n41: | `get_similar_videos` | Videos similar to one specific video | Find 10 similar videos to see what hooks worked |\r\n42: | `get_video_transcript` | Spoken transcript of one video | Study a competitor's script pacing/structure |\r\n43: | `get_bulk_video_transcripts` | Transcripts for up to 10 videos at once | Batch-study a whole competitor series |\r\n44: | `get_video_subtitle` | Subtitle/caption track of one video | Translate or repurpose captions into blog content |\r\n45: | `get_bulk_video_subtitles` | Subtitles for up to 10 videos at once | Batch subtitle pull for a whole playlist |\r\n46: | `get_similar_thumbnails` | Thumbnails visually similar to a description/image | \"Find thumbnails similar to red-arrow-shocked-face style\" |\r\n47: | `get_channel_analytics` | Growth, engagement, key metrics for one channel | Full competitor teardown before entering their niche |\r\n48: | `get_daily_analytics` | Day-by-day growth data | Spot which exact video caused a competitor's sub spike |\r\n49: | `get_short_vs_long_views` | Shorts vs long-form performance comparison | Decide whether to lean Shorts or long-form |\r\n50: | `get_geography_revenue` | Audience country breakdown + estimated RPM | Check if a niche's audience skews US/UK before committing |\r\n51: | `get_batch_channel_metrics` | Side-by-side RPM/views comparison, up to 10 channels | Compare 8 competitor channels in one shot |\r\n52: | `check_channel_monetization` | Checks if a channel has ads enabled | Verify a competitor is actually monetized |\r\n53: | `check_video_monetization` | Same, for one video | Check if a demonetized-topic video still has ads |\r\n54: | `get_video_rpm` | Estimated earnings-per-1000-views for one video | Test if \"crypto explained\" pays better before scripting |\r\n55: | `get_niche_overview` | Full niche analysis from one channel — competitors, VPH | Map an entire competitive landscape from one channel |\r\n56: | `get_niche_finder_tags` | Topic/theme tags used in niche search | Discover trending content themes in a niche |\r\n57: | `get_channel_promotions` | A channel's off-platform income: sponsors, own products | See what a competitor sells beyond ads |\r\n58: \r\n59: ## 2/day\r\n60: | Tool | What it does | Example use |\r\n61: |---|---|---|\r\n62: | `get_channel_promotions_realtime` | Live-scrapes one channel's promotions (slow fallback) | Use only when `get_channel_promotions` has no data |\r\n63: \r\n64: ## 1/day\r\n65: | Tool | What it does | Example use |\r\n66: |---|---|---|\r\n67: | `watch_youtube_video_and_ask` | AI actually \"watches\" a video and answers questions | \"Watch this and tell me the hook structure in first 15 sec\" |\r\n68: | `watch_instagram_video_and_ask` | Same, for Instagram Reels | \"Watch this viral Reel and tell me why it's working\" |\r\n69: | `watch_tiktok_video_and_ask` | Same, for TikTok | Adapt a TikTok trend for YouTube Shorts |\r\n70: \r\n71: ## 0/day (Free plan has no access — Lite/Pro/Premium only)\r\n72: | Tool | What it does | Example use |\r\n73: |---|---|---|\r\n74: | `get_content_owner` | Looks up which CMS network owns a channel/video | Check if a big channel is backed by a media network |\r\n75: | `search_cms_networks` | Researches CMS networks and their rosters | \"What channels are under [Network]?\" |\r\n76: | `save_to_swipefile` | Saves a channel/video/thumbnail to a research folder | Save a great hook mid-research |\r\n77: | `list_swipefile_folders` | Lists your saved folders | Review your research organization |\r\n78: | `list_swipefile_items` | Lists items in a folder | Pull up saved items before planning |\r\n79: | `create_swipefile_folder` | Makes a new folder | Create a \"Thumbnail Inspiration\" folder |\r\n80: | `update_swi