{"step_index":127,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:18:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-26T00:48:09+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-26T00:48:09+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/nexlev/check_faceless_channel.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 1075\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"check_faceless_channel\",\"description\":\"Use this when you need to determine if a specific YouTube channel is \\\"faceless\\\" (creator doesn't appear on camera) and classify its content type.\\n\\nDo NOT use this for finding faceless channels broadly — use latest_discovered_faceless_niches or search_niche_finder_channels with isFaceless=true instead. This tool analyzes ONE channel at a time.\\n\\nReturns: isFaceless (boolean), confidence (0-1), content tags, category, format (documentary/tutorial/commentary etc.), language, and a suggested Google Trends keyword.\\n\\nIMPORTANT: Channel ID must be 24 characters starting with \\\"UC\\\". Fresh analysis takes 10-30 seconds. Cached results return instantly.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"channelId\":{\"description\":\"YouTube channel ID to analyze (24 characters, starts with UC). Example: UCvjtdOfgCIs9vrq4SwOpN8g\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"shortsOnly\":{\"description\":\"If true, analyze YouTube Shorts instead of regular videos. Default: false\",\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"channelId\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
